SITEMAP.XML — entries to add to your existing sitemap
=========================================================
Add these two <url> entries inside the existing <urlset> in your
root sitemap.xml (don't replace the file, just add these entries):

  <url>
    <loc>https://hoberg.com.ng/tools/</loc>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.7</priority>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://hoberg.com.ng/tools/tikdrop/</loc>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.8</priority>
  </url>